            "Kabaanc kahak )}3 zayou e;",
            "Lat piu chuymei ziab ai sw ni,",
            "Kabaanc )}3 zayloupui zaeng )}3.",
            "",
            "2 Ryanra zinghmei ganv khou punic,",
            "Eden mwnpic chung khou punic,",
            "Chunghmei, kamuatcmei dui khou nic,",
            "Zayloumei hei Ravguangc baanc e.",
            "",
            "3 Kaipouc, Nang baanc guakc tanv bam ni,",
            "Nang ta ai nrauc zat lak ge;",
            "San khou pat tuang guay neihlaa ni,",
            "Ravguangc baanc )}3 zaylou zaeng )}3.",
            "",
            "4 Kandih khou ataanv luai pwkhou,",
            "Nang zauzian paan rih ngam pwkhou,",
            "Theihmei ta nganv ai ping lak khe,",
            "Jordan Nang zay kaanlou zaeng )}3."
